  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Sandip Mishra\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Sandip Mishra</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 17, 2026 at 07:46 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/bhubaneswar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bhubaneswar</a>: All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS) Bhubaneswar on Sunday inaugurated three upgraded laboratory facilities that will boost its specialised diagnostic capabilities and make it the first govt healthcare institution in the state to offer several advanced screening and testing services, the institute said on Monday through an official statement.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p><a href=\"/tag/antenatal+and+newborn+screening\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Antenatal and newborn screening</a>, immunology and high-performance liquid chromatography laboratories, established under the department of biochemistry, were inaugurated by <a href=\"/tag/ashutosh+biswas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ashutosh Biswas</a>, executive director and CEO of <a href=\"/tag/aiims+bhubaneswar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AIIMS Bhubaneswar</a>.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Officials said the upgraded facilities would reduce dependence on out-of-state healthcare centres for advanced diagnostic tests.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Biswas said the advanced diagnostic platform can detect extremely low concentrations of substances in samples such as urine and cerebrospinal fluid, opening up new possibilities for disease diagnosis.The antenatal and newborn screening laboratory has been equipped with a new fluorometer and will offer expanded screening for newborn disorders, including <a href=\"/tag/phenylketonuria+%28pku%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">phenylketonuria (PKU)</a> and <a href=\"/tag/cystic+fibrosis+%28cf%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cystic fibrosis (CF)</a>.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It will also provide comprehensive antenatal screening through dual-marker, triple-marker and penta-marker tests for risk assessment during pregnancy.</p><p>The <a href=\"/tag/immunology+laboratory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">immunology laboratory</a> has been strengthened with a nephelometer to expand the tests to support the diagnosis of immune disorders, kidney diseases and transplantation-related investigations.Meanwhile, HPLC Laboratory has been equipped with a high-throughput analyser for <a href=\"/tag/hba1c+testing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">HbA1c testing</a>, considered the gold standard for diabetes monitoring. AIIMS Bhubaneswar said it is the first AIIMS in the country to procure the advanced system.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Hospital authorities said that the upgraded facilities would enhance diagnostic accuracy, improve early disease detection and make advanced tests more affordable and accessible for patients across the region.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Sandip Mishra</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Sandip Mishra</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 17, 2026 at 07:46 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 17, 2026 at 07:46 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferr